    <section class="shell section"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-index">01 / PLATFORM</div><div class="section-title"><h2>One foundation, three ways to move work forward.</h2><p>Turn a durable object model into usable software, governed intelligence, and connected execution—without splitting context across separate systems.</p></div></div><div class="grid-3"><article class="card pillar"><span class="num">01</span><div class="icon-box">{ }</div><h3>Build apps</h3><p>Define custom objects, relationships, screens, and dashboards around how your organization actually works.</p><a class="pillar-link route" href="/platform" data-page="product-apps">Explore app building →</a></article><article class="card pillar"><span class="num">02</span><div class="icon-box">AI</div><h3>Create agents</h3><p>Give agents governed access to the same model, tools, and records your applications already understand.</p><a class="pillar-link route" href="/agent-foundry" data-page="product-agents">Explore agent building →</a></article><article class="card pillar"><span class="num">03</span><div class="icon-box">↳</div><h3>Orchestrate everything</h3><p>Coordinate workflows, business rules, schedules, integrations, and approvals as one observable system.</p><a class="pillar-link route" href="/product/orchestration" data-page="product-orchestration">Explore orchestration →</a></article></div></section>
